  floor2_NPC2: "I'll bet if you keep going up the'll have rooms to stay the night."
  floor2_NPC2: "<cascade-letters color=LIGHTGREY>Although I haven't been up there yet."
  floor2_NPC2: "What gives?"
  +endConversation()

